    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσβῐάζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>force one's way into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὰ πρῶτα γένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Num.</u>
				</span></i>
			I; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					14.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸν Βόσπορον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					42.47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b><i>force
				oneself in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ μὲν γὰρ ὢν οὐκ ἀστὸς ἐσβιάζεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					32
