				2685
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Iasos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				736.6
			</span></i>(Fayûm), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.39
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.</div>
